      "releaseNotes": "Introducing Manus 2.0\n- Remote Control: Control your computer or cloud computer from your phone.\n- Manus Studio Collaboration: Let Manus write code, use the apps on your computer, and edit docs, slides, and videos with you.\n- Phone & Cloud Computer: Buy a phone number or cloud computer for Manus to get things done.\n- Bug Fixes: Performance improvements and stability fixes.",
